title: "WM-811K Wafer-Map Defect Classifier"
abstract: >-
  A production-quality, leakage-free deep-learning pipeline for wafer-map
  defect-pattern classification on the WM-811K dataset, with automated dataset
  acquisition, Grad-CAM explainability, and deployment export.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "wm-wafer-map contributors"
license: MIT
